  (text "FB1 = unswitched fuse box (compute side)   |   FB2 = switched fuse box after contactor K1 (actuator side)"
    (at 20.32 25.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "a8fe1bbc-44dd-4ec3-a85f-713ec0124bad")
  )
  (text "FB1  UNSWITCHED  (not cut by E-stop)"
    (at 35.56 40.64 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "b2032825-c985-46cc-96cb-8bb94e775fde")
  )
  (text "FB2  SWITCHED  (cut by E-stop via K1)"
    (at 182.88 40.64 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "079f33d1-eb2f-410c-8ab1-4d389f3aee50")
  )
  (text "NOTES"
    (at 20.32 177.8 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "27ed3654-71eb-4f85-81c0-6b5ca0e10c72")
  )
  (text "1. Every branch fuse sits in FB1/FB2 at the start of its wire. Wire gauge shown in each fuse value; fuse <= wire and connector rating."
    (at 20.32 182.88 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "f766c12f-507a-4d52-a4f7-ce32713cb72a")
  )
  (text "2. REG12 (REGULATED_12V) is required for lead-acid or LiFePO4: ST3215 limit 12.6 V, raw battery reaches 14.4-14.6 V. Omit only for a 3S Li-ion pack."
    (at 20.32 187.96 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "b2c10271-3b5e-43fd-a257-aec7cb60e441")
  )
  (text "3. U1 reverse-polarity stage protects the Jetson branch. High-current branches rely on keyed J_BATT + F_MAIN."
    (at 20.32 193.04 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "fe4db818-0fd8-48d9-bf93-2a50527ecfe8")
  )
  (text "4. TVS_BUS 18 V stand-off: above LiFePO4 14.6 V charge voltage (GEN - recheck if chemistry differs)."
    (at 20.32 198.12 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "419d5055-401f-49ef-aae5-bdb936a87969")
  )
  (text "5. Pre-charge not fitted: generic REG12 input capacitance is small for an 80 A contactor. Re-check with the real REG12."
    (at 20.32 203.2 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "9cd97a30-23e9-439a-becd-46f21a531dca")
  )
  (text "6. Arm 5 V rail: EA75-5V as in V1. Follower servo type on V2 (7.4 V or 12 V) is TBD - 5 V is safe for both."
    (at 20.32 208.28 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "dfc81834-444f-47c2-bd99-b644c6f90941")
  )
  (text "7. HUB PSU stays on the unswitched side so cameras, LiDAR and adapter logic keep working after an E-stop."
    (at 20.32 213.36 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "3049a536-e8a1-4bab-9619-1b82554c2242")
  )
  (text "8. #FLG = ERC power flags only (rail enters through a passive fuse). Not physical parts."
    (at 20.32 218.44 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "93257783-38f3-48cf-9f7f-a1a7caae117e")
  )
